                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bf583cc0-aec7-38e1-b82b-22246272a458",
                        "entry_id": "2a028dc4-092a-3e99-a771-1339ffd5a34a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. связанный, соотносящийся по значению с существительным фокус; фокусный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb3048bc-7237-41e3-b5bb-8d65e30a64f7",
                                "sense_id": "bf583cc0-aec7-38e1-b82b-22246272a458",
                                "text": "Она отсекает свет, поступающий от источников света, находящихся вне фокусной плоскости, то есть увеличивает контрастность изображения именно фокального оптического среза."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3f00badb-694c-3412-be5c-6df667781c76",
                        "entry_id": "2a028dc4-092a-3e99-a771-1339ffd5a34a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мед. относящийся к очагу патологического процесса"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "abc1e328-1539-431c-9467-5db0ce7dcfe1",
                                "sense_id": "3f00badb-694c-3412-be5c-6df667781c76",
                                "text": "При простых фокальных приступах сознание больного полностью сохранено, эпилептический разряд остается локализованным и не распространяется на другие области коры."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fa32ad9c-516b-4099-84a6-61875e8e4b31",
                        "source_entry_id": "2a028dc4-092a-3e99-a771-1339ffd5a34a",
                        "target_lang_word": "focal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "focal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f97f30eb-9914-33a0-a940-626b9f022b34",
                                        "entry_id": "d2e977aa-7782-384b-b722-1a44852e95c7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Belonging to, concerning, or located at a focus."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af7a9dd4-7f6d-3ce1-b015-e2c9fda8723c",
                                        "entry_id": "d2e977aa-7782-384b-b722-1a44852e95c7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Limited to a small area."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "focal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69cff01e-c2f0-3a93-804f-a0f1f43b728a",
                                        "entry_id": "88b1abb3-5af1-35c3-9250-8abfa0c1787d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One of two lines perpendicular to the axis of a cone such that the cosine of the angle between the line and the axis is equal to the ratio of the cosines o the semiangles of the cone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b971873-2c9f-418f-9f3b-cee6e6a482fb",
                                                "sense_id": "69cff01e-c2f0-3a93-804f-a0f1f43b728a",
                                                "text": "Again, if the plane of the impressed couple intersects the mean plane between N and C, it will envelope the cone whose focals are ON, ON′, and whose internal axis is therefore OA."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54a94b0c-06f8-3c8f-b7e4-d9e86a58b408",
                                        "entry_id": "88b1abb3-5af1-35c3-9250-8abfa0c1787d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An object that is used to focus concentration when performing magic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7e0873a-ee76-4cd1-af01-7e631d0747cc",
                                                "sense_id": "54a94b0c-06f8-3c8f-b7e4-d9e86a58b408",
                                                "text": "And no witch leaves behind focals."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56873e19-e9e6-417d-9bf4-3ad9491ea9b8",
                                                "sense_id": "54a94b0c-06f8-3c8f-b7e4-d9e86a58b408",
                                                "text": "I use focals for aura work sometimes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a635d659-d5c2-42e0-8be5-b840922aa3e9",
                                                "sense_id": "54a94b0c-06f8-3c8f-b7e4-d9e86a58b408",
                                                "text": "Choose your focals to blend well with the intention of your magical work or ritual."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9aec598-a66d-3ff2-954d-91832174b8dd",
                                        "entry_id": "88b1abb3-5af1-35c3-9250-8abfa0c1787d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The individual who is the focus of a study or review, when the study or review is based on that individual's interactions with others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7efe3206-35eb-4638-ae44-40b5219872b3",
                                                "sense_id": "f9aec598-a66d-3ff2-954d-91832174b8dd",
                                                "text": "As predicted, focals who were paired with peers produced significantly higher levels of reasoning at posttest ( M = 35.34, SD = 4.44 ) than did focals paired with adults."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c76f243c-1edc-4955-8988-0f051570d8bd",
                                                "sense_id": "f9aec598-a66d-3ff2-954d-91832174b8dd",
                                                "text": "Thirty-one percent of the focals rated as low transformational by subordinates at time 1 were engaging in two of these three leadership/management styles, and 54% of the focals rated as low transformational were engaging in only one of the three styles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae38bc42-b497-4478-93be-2068e8211326",
                                                "sense_id": "f9aec598-a66d-3ff2-954d-91832174b8dd",
                                                "text": "As this study covered 46 individual play behaviors, I did not have time to statistically analyze each individual behavior against all age intervals, for all three focals."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c64b67f-3c91-48e6-8aa6-1d73f5962796",
                                                "sense_id": "f9aec598-a66d-3ff2-954d-91832174b8dd",
                                                "text": "Relevancy provides focals motivation to change by making the links clear between their behavior and the success of the organization."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a09938bc-5d66-368d-ad41-a555dd8232b2",
                                        "entry_id": "88b1abb3-5af1-35c3-9250-8abfa0c1787d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A representative of a group or class of people within an organizational system."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5260943-5369-47ba-9065-3bdc73640562",
                                                "sense_id": "a09938bc-5d66-368d-ad41-a555dd8232b2",
                                                "text": "Attempting to balance priorities across the exploration, science, and aeronautics programs requires constant and complex negotiations betwen the center focals, the projects they represent, and Langley's engineering directorates."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2ff9c85-0e37-4bf7-a4f3-d688382415c2",
                                                "sense_id": "a09938bc-5d66-368d-ad41-a555dd8232b2",
                                                "text": "Consolidate all focals' requirements: To be done by the Operations Manager."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "879b47d4-c196-4850-99a1-b89687f1da19",
                                                "sense_id": "a09938bc-5d66-368d-ad41-a555dd8232b2",
                                                "text": "Providing technical support to regional climate and WSG focals of all operational divisions on water resilience will amplify the larger pool of project officers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "890f405e-4933-396a-bbe8-8d416f9f2bdd",
                                        "entry_id": "88b1abb3-5af1-35c3-9250-8abfa0c1787d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sign or similar type of marketing material designed to draw attention to special deals."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00841f22-734b-4b4f-95e4-d612b04faf0f",
                                                "sense_id": "890f405e-4933-396a-bbe8-8d416f9f2bdd",
                                                "text": "Gesturing at the cleanliness of the design, Medill says, “Originally we had 'focals,'“—signs that call out special offers—“but they blocked eyeballs.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16b2c02c-5611-36c6-a83a-2f7f4d12c70d",
                                        "entry_id": "88b1abb3-5af1-35c3-9250-8abfa0c1787d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The central or most important element of something; a focal element."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dedd726-dc10-4856-9624-583327d554e4",
                                                "sense_id": "16b2c02c-5611-36c6-a83a-2f7f4d12c70d",
                                                "text": "We become \"native speakers,\" but variably with respect to numerous valued/powered criteria of truth/goodness/beauty (focals) and their derivative values which \"leave\" \"some” more valuable ( as speakers ) than others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c57da962-e7dd-40d7-84e2-c934574164cb",
                                                "sense_id": "16b2c02c-5611-36c6-a83a-2f7f4d12c70d",
                                                "text": "When using supporting flowers, consider their size and shape in relation to the focals and how the colour supports and enhances them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "014ccd38-45d8-3ab8-a273-6219fa49213f",
                                        "entry_id": "88b1abb3-5af1-35c3-9250-8abfa0c1787d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A major point of interest; an attraction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe3665db-d39a-4a38-a253-e1dd8bd7ef6d",
                                                "sense_id": "014ccd38-45d8-3ab8-a273-6219fa49213f",
                                                "text": "In the Visual Survey Analysis Report, focals are divided into four categories; visual, historical, symbolic, and cultural focals. Focals might correspond to the Kevin Lynch definition of landmarks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b4f246f-f161-3c9a-8548-2266c2f59b29",
                                        "entry_id": "88b1abb3-5af1-35c3-9250-8abfa0c1787d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An exemplar of a concept."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1581cc73-c61c-4b5d-9753-510df1d4cdc3",
